# Built code leans on the sketch: `run` makes the prophetized `Store` and writes the report to it, and both are
# `todo!()`, so the built route has no effect.

route archive.run
step run/Store.new
step run/Store.write

line entry > run call
line run/Store.new > Store@run/Store.new value
line Store@run/Store.new > run/Store.write value

home Store@run/Store.new run

side entry left
